  "_comment": "Every item with EF_VOLATILE is discovered automatically from itemlist.csv. Rules under items fully replace the code rule for one specific item (matched by INDEX). Balance numbers (affectValue = %, durationUnits = 8-second blocks, exp) are tunable here without recompiling.",
